{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16073","headline":"照镜 · 王建","name":"照镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日自缠绕，此身无适缘。\n万愁生旅夜，百病凑衰年。\n少睡憎明屋，慵行待暖天。\n痒头梳有蝨，风耳炙闻蝉。\n摇白方多错，回金法不全。\n家贫何所恋，时在老僧边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}